cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Medata SingleMA"
version: "1.0"
date-released: 2026-11-18
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Chen"
    given-names: "Hsiu-Min"
    affiliation: "Medata Statistical Consulting Co., Ltd."
license: GPL-3.0-only
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.24334917
repository-code: "https://github.com/cshowme/singlema"
url: "https://singlema.medatatw.com"
abstract: >-
  Medata SingleMA is a free web application for single-arm
  meta-analysis of proportions, means, and incidence rates
  (events per person-time). Analyses are performed with the R
  package meta. The application runs in the user's web browser
  through webR and Shinylive.
keywords:
  - single-arm meta-analysis
  - meta-analysis of proportions
  - meta-analysis of means
  - incidence rate
  - person-time
  - R
  - meta
  - webR
  - Shinylive
